# Only application files enter the build context; credentials, runs, and notes stay out.
*
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!requirements.lock
!src/
!src/**
!frontend/
!frontend/**
# The image installs and builds its own Linux copies of these.
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/**
